#!/usr/bin/env bash
set -euo pipefail

cat >&2 <<'MESSAGE'
BLOCKED: replacing production storage from staging is intentionally disabled.

The former implementation deleted the production volume before validating the
source, backup, copy, or rollback path. Use script/backup_storage to create and
verify a snapshot, then restore it into a new empty volume with
script/restore_storage. Cutover to that volume must be a separately reviewed
operator action with a tested rollback.
MESSAGE

exit 64
